      "comment": "Sebas: Rhinedottir's messages",
      "content": "Sebas carries Rhinedottir's messages in her own voice, using a technique that he later says he will destroy. To Albedo she says that a solved problem loses its interest and he should pose questions of his own; to Durin she says he may be the key to unexpected answers in an experiment she has never run.\n\nShe also sent a 'gift' to Albedo, which Sebas placed on the table before leaving.",
