      "comment": "Sebas: Albedo and Sebas",
      "content": "Albedo says Rhinedottir created Sebas long before him, so by an ordinary family's standards Sebas is his elder, but his family is far from ordinary. Sebas looked after him by tidying vials and jars and modelled for his sketches.\n\nAlbedo draws Sebas when he needs to think, letting his subconscious take over.",
